  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（樹里は……レッスンの真っ最中か……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（どのタイミングで声、掛けようか……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0358",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "──ストップ！\r\nなんていうか……絶賛迷走中だね？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003040010,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……はい、すみません",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "3000110030",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "008",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100304/1011003040010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003040020,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "なんか、考えれば考えるほど\r\nこんがらがるっつーか",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100304/1011003040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "まあ、まだ全然チャンスはあるんだし\r\n今悩めるうちに悩めるだけ悩んじゃいな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003040030,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……うーん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100304/1011003040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "宿題にしてた『曲と振りの理解』と\r\n『魅力的な表情の研究』はできてなくはないんだよね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003040040,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……！\r\nそっか、よかった……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100304/1011003040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "表情も前よりは全然良くなった……けど\r\nあと一歩、樹里ちゃんらしさっていうかさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "樹里ちゃんの持ってる魅力と\r\n樹里ちゃんの求められてる魅力がバチーンとハマる感じ？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003040050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "バチーンとハマる感じ……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100304/1011003040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003040060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "って、どんな感じなんだ……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100304/1011003040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "うーん……どうしようか\r\n──あの、プロデューサーさん！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ！？　ああ、はい！",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003040070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……！\r\nプロデューサー、また来てたのか……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100304/1011003040070"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "トレーナー",
    "text": "樹里ちゃん、宿題の『自分の魅力はなんなのか』が\r\nできてないみたいなんですよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうなんですか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それじゃあ、樹里\r\n──これ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0099",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003040080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "え…………",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101100304/1011003040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003040090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "これって、\r\nラジオに届いてたやつか……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100304/1011003040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう、『樹里の魅力』に届いたメッセージを\r\n全てプリントアウトしたものだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003040100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "紙……！\r\nこんなに使って、もったいねー……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100304/1011003040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、大丈夫\r\nもったいなくなんてないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こうやって印刷して持っておけば\r\nいつでも見られるしな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003040110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……まぁ、そうだな\r\nかなり重いけど……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100304/1011003040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、うん\r\nファンのみんなの想いがつまってるからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一度全部に目を通したとは思うけどさ\r\nまた、見てみたらどうかなって思ったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003040120,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……！\r\nおー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100304/1011003040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003040130,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……ありがとな、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100304/1011003040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1011003040140,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシ、ちょっと\r\nこれ読んできます……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101100304/1011003040140"
  },
